          "text": "Description: On December 11, 2009, around 8:00 PM, an individual observed a white light in the clear sky that intrigued them. This stationary phenomenon, after a rising trajectory, was observed for 10 minutes by the witness who took a photograph. Unfortunately, this photo is unusable. No other testimony corroborates this observation for which we lack information and details.",
